      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "化简新方程的左边和右边，得：",
        "$x=9$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "9是方程$x+6=15$的根，因为等式$9+6=15$成立."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例2.解方程$x-8=13$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在方程的左、右两边各加$-8$的相反数8：",
        "$x-8+8=13+8$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "左边得$x$，右边得21.于是$x=21$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例3.解方程$48-(25+x)=33$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把方程左边的括号去掉：",
        "$48-25-x=33$，",
        "$23-x=33$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "左边和右边各加$-23$：",
        "$23-x-23=33-23$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "得：$-x=10$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "假如$x$的相反数等于10，那么$x$等于$-10$：",
        "$x=-10$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "464",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "解方程：",
        "1) $y+9=-5$；5) $a+2.8=16$；",
        "2) $x-3=-17$；6) $b-3.2=4.1$；",
        "3) $10-x=-5$；7) $7-m=5.3$；",
        "4) $-5+c=21$；8) $-x-1.1=0.9$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "465",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "列方程解下列各题：",
        "1) 从$-80.7$中减去什么数，结果等于20.1？",
        "2) 当$m$是什么数值时，式$m-8.1$等于$-57$？",
        "3) 当$y$是什么数值时，式$110-y$的值等于2.03？"
      ]
    },
